sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant Gate
    participant VisitDB as Visits schema
    participant Catalog as Attractions API
    Note over Staff,Gate: Administrator access token required
    Staff->>Gate: Signed ticket + full party count
    Gate->>Gate: Verify public-key signature, date, expiry and claims
    Gate->>VisitDB: Atomic unique check-in + arrival outbox
    VisitDB-->>Gate: Stored guest arrival (or duplicate conflict)
    Gate-->>Staff: Arrival result
    Note over Gate: Booking API is not called
    Staff->>Gate: Ride event ID + checked-in reference + rider count
    Gate->>VisitDB: Check arrival and party size
    Gate->>Catalog: Verify open attraction + request ID
    Catalog-->>Gate: Status (or fail closed)
    Gate->>VisitDB: Atomic deduplicated ride + outbox
    Gate-->>Staff: Recorded or duplicate result
